o all&#x27;incirca 82 km. Vai al tuo ritmo — l&#x27;audio parte automaticamente mentre ti muovi.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Questo tour è accessibile?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Questo percorso è classificato come: Accessibile. Controlla ogni tappa per i dettagli specifici di accesso.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">In quali lingue è disponibile?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Questo tour è disponibile in: English, Español, Português, Italiano.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Mi serve una connessione internet?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">No. Scarica il tour nell&#x27;app Tuggi e ascolta offline — l&#x27;audio si attiva in base alla tua posizione, a mani libere.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Posso farlo a piedi o in auto?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Questo percorso è pensato per un viaggio Facile. L&#x27;audio si adatta al tuo ritmo.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-3xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-8\">Altri tour nelle vicinanze</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/it/tours/united-states/disney-de-graca-sem-ingressos\"><div class=\"bg-tuggi-bg border-b border-gray-100\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 62\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M78 41L74.9 42L70.9 40.5L72.4 36.9L73.2 37.6L72.3 36.9L70.8 40.5L67.1 40.9L65 40.4L64 38L60.9 38L60.7 39.3L60.4